t(tau) = E*integrate(u(s), s, 0, tau) + t0 ;  x(tau) = p1*integrate(u(s), s, 0, tau) + x0
dx/dt = (dx/dtau)/(dt/dtau) = p1/E
x as a function of t: (T - t0)*p1/E + x0  -- independent of u
u = 1 : x - x0 - (p1/E)(t - t0) = 0
u = 1/2*sin(tau) + 1 : x - x0 - (p1/E)(t - t0) = 0
u = e^(-1/3*tau) : x - x0 - (p1/E)(t - t0) = 0
